  "description": "Managed PDF reader, rasterizer and page assembler for DocWright. Opens any PDF (damaged and password-encrypted ones included), renders its pages to PNG or JPEG, and builds new PDFs from existing pages (delete, extract, reorder, merge, split, duplicate) without rasterizing or re-encoding them, with links, destinations, outlines and page labels repaired. It does not import a PDF into an editable document, and writing a document as PDF is DocWright.Renderers.Pdf. Installed automatically by DocWright.",
